title: CDC's corruption case deepens
subtitle: The "problem of the 3%" may have indeed more than slander
view-if: year = 2015 and month = 1
tags: event
new-page: true
face-image: img/events/trespercent.webp
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
    for (var c of Q.parlament_constituencies) {
        if (Q.jxsi_formed) {
            if (Q.cup_in_jxsi) {
                Q["jxsi_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] -= 0.75;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] += 0.75;
                Q["jxsi_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] -= 0.5;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] += 0.5;
                Q["jxsi_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] -= 0.25;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] += 0.25;
            } else {
                Q["jxsi_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] -= 0.75;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] += 0.5;
                Q["cup_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] += 0.25;
                Q["jxsi_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] -= 0.6;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] += 0.1;
                Q["cup_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] += 0.5;
                Q["jxsi_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] -= 0.5;
                Q["cup_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] += 0.4;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] += 0.1;
            }
        } else if (Q.jxcat_formed && Q.erc_in_jxcat) {
            if (Q.cup_in_jxcat) {
                Q["jxcat_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] -= 0.75;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] += 0.75;
                Q["jxcat_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] -= 0.5;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] += 0.5;
                Q["jxcat_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] -= 0.25;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] += 0.25;
            } else {
                Q["jxcat_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] -= 0.75;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] += 0.5;
                Q["cup_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] += 0.25;
                Q["jxcat_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] -= 0.6;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] += 0.1;
                Q["cup_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] += 0.5;
                Q["jxcat_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] -= 0.5;
                Q["cup_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] += 0.4;
                Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] += 0.1;
            }
        } else {
            Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] -= 1;
            Q["erc_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] += 0.5;
            Q["cup_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] += 0.1;
            Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] += 0.4;
            Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] -= 1;
            Q["erc_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] += 0.3;
            Q["cup_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] += 0.4;
            Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] += 0.3;
            Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] -= 1;
            Q["erc_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] += 0.4;
            Q["cup_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] += 0.4;
            Q["abstain_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] += 0.2;
        }
    } 
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", 0.5, Q.parlament_current_ciu);
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "abstain", "catalunya", 0.5, Q.parlament_current_ciu);
    Q.corruption_events_ciu += 1;
!}
role: event

= The deepening of ​CDC's corruption cases

The multiple cases orbiting around CDC, from the Palau case to the Pujol family affair, have now for years hit heavily the credibility of the party. Nonetheless, the big rumoured corruption network has been, for years, the unproven but loudly rumoured "3%-system". In this scheme, businessmen across Catalonia would benefit from rigged public contracts in exchange for a donation of roughly 3% of the contract's value to foundations linked to the party. A recent police investigation in CDC-ruled Torredembarra (near Tarragona) may have finally have provided enough proof to open an official investigation, and former party members are starting to get indicted. 

- @post_event: Pasqual Maragall already said it in 2005...
